# Azerbaijani (North) → IPA transliteration rules (az_ipa.rules)
#
# Source-Authors: Ghaffarvand Mokari, P. & Werner, S.
# Source-Year: 2017
# Source-Title: Azerbaijani
# Source-Container: Journal of the International Phonetic Association 47(2): 207-212
# Source-Id: https://doi.org/10.1017/S0025100317000184
#
# SCOPE: the cited Illustration describes the Tabriz variety (p. 207),
# written in Arabic script; these rules map the Latin alphabet of the
# Baku standard. Its chart (p. 208) has an alveolar affricate pair the
# Baku standard lacks and parenthesises the palatal and velar plosives,
# so only the shared inventory is taken from it. Both page readings were
# confirmed by a second reader. This is the journal's only Azerbaijani
# Illustration (CrossRef record for ISSN 0025-1003, checked 2026-08).
#
# Corroborated by the variety-matched description: Ragagnin, E. (2021)
# 'Azeri', in Johanson & Csató (eds.), The Turkic Languages, 2nd ed.,
# Routledge, 242-261 (https://doi.org/10.4324/9781003243809-17): Baku
# standard (p. 242), the same nine vowels (p. 243), affricates č and ǰ
# with the alveolar pair dialectal, "vs. standard Azeri čay and geǰä"
# (p. 244). Word pairs pinned in test_azerbaijani_ragagnin_words.py.
#
# Simplified: no vowel length, no stress, no aspiration marking, no dental vs. alveolar
# distinctions, no automatic final devoicing, no systematic palatal/velar allophony.

# The map below is context-free. Azerbaijani has fronting and rounding
# harmony (p. 4), but the orthography writes every vowel, so a
# grapheme-to-phoneme transform never has to compute a harmonic value and
# nothing here needs the harmony classes of Table 1. They were once
# declared as macros no rule referred to, and have been removed.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 1. ONE-TO-ONE GRAPHEME → IPA MAP  (Latin script → segmental IPA)

A > ɑ ;  a > ɑ ;
B > b ;  b > b ;
C > d͡ʒ ;  c > d͡ʒ ;
Ç > t͡ʃ ;  ç > t͡ʃ ;
D > d ;  d > d ;
E > e ;  e > e ;
Ə > æ ;  ə > æ ;
F > f ;  f > f ;
G > ɟ ;  g > ɟ ;
Ğ > ɣ ;  ğ > ɣ ;
H > h ;  h > h ;
X > x ;  x > x ;
I > ɯ ;  ı > ɯ ;
İ > i ;  i > i ;
J > ʒ ;  j > ʒ ;
K > k ;  k > k ;
Q > ɡ ;  q > ɡ ;
L > l ;  l > l ;
M > m ;  m > m ;
N > n ;  n > n ;
O > o ;  o > o ;
Ö > œ ;  ö > œ ;
P > p ;  p > p ;
R > ɾ ;  r > ɾ ;
S > s ;  s > s ;
Ş > ʃ ;  ş > ʃ ;
T > t ;  t > t ;
U > u ;  u > u ;
Ü > y ;  ü > y ;
V > v ;  v > v ;
Y > j ;  y > j ;
Z > z ;  z > z ;

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

:: NFC ;
